OL,3,ADrivers may get compensation offers
OL,4,Abefore car finance saga ends
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers may be offered compensation
OL,7,Ffrom lenders ahead of the next legal
OL,8,Fbattle in the car finance mis-selling
OL,9,Fsaga.
OL,11,FRegulator the Financial Conduct
OL,12,FAuthority (FCA) said it would welcome
OL,13,Flenders making settlement offers as
OL,14,Flong as customers were not given a
OL,15,Fworse deal than under its proposed
OL,16,Fcentral scheme.
OL,18,FThat scheme is facing a legal
OL,19,Fchallenge, to be heard in February,
OL,20,Fwith resulting compensation unlikely to
OL,21,Fbe paid until late next year.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
